  "details": "I made a tool that takes pictures through the OSC endpoint /usercamera/Capture.\n\nThis works great as long as the CameraUI is on. \n\nWhen I enable the spout stream and disable the CameraUI, the spout stream stays accessible, but when i send /usercamera/Capture, nothing happens. \n\nWould it be possible to allow taking pictures through OSC, when the spout camera is active, even if the CameraUI is closed? \n\nThank you for your work :)",
